<h1>Constellation25 Platform Specification</h1>
<h2>25 Planetary Agents - 6 Clusters</h2>
<ul>
<li>SCAFFOLD: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars</li>
<li>SECURITY: Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune</li>
<li>RUNTIME: Pluto, Ceres, Eris, Makemake</li>
<li>ORCHESTR: Haumea (Neo), Sedna (Morpheus), Quaoar (oRiKAL), Orcus</li>
<li>DEPLOY: Varuna, Ixion, Chaos, Huya</li>
<li>MONITOR: Salacia, Altjira, Varda, Gonggong, Deimos</li>
</ul>
<h2>File Types</h2>
<ul>
<li>.sh - Bash agent scripts</li>
<li>.json - Configuration & manifests</li>
<li>.md - Documentation</li>
<li>.go - Go modules (MCP server)</li>
<li>.fastapi - Python FastAPI endpoints</li>
<li>.mht - Archived documentation</li>
</ul>
</body>
